# Chrome Dome's token "gains haste": the haste is an effect on that token (layer 6, CR 613.1f), not part of its copiable
# values, which are the Ornithopter's as printed (CR 707.2; the rulings: "The token copies exactly what was printed on the
# original artifact"). Unlike Kiki-Jiki's "except it has haste" (CR 707.9b), a Phyrexian Metamorph that enters as a copy of
# the token is a plain Ornithopter, a flyer without haste, and it is not sacrificed at the end step; the token is.

